{{!-- The TFR rail, first on the page and pinned under the masthead as on the reader (Ian, 2026-09-23). --}}
{{> "faith-received/_tfr-rail"}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>Controversies | The Faith Received | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="The controversies as the library's own controversy literature argued them, debate by debate and question by question: Thomists and Scotists (with the Nominalists and the Jesuits), Rome and the Reformation, the Reformed and their adversaries, the Lutherans and the Socinians, each side in his own words from the library's pages." />
<link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel=stylesheet href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Source+Serif+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap">
<style>
.tfr-tool{--bg:var(--color-bg,#F0F0ED);--fg:var(--color-dark,#1C1C1A);--muted:var(--color-muted,#5A5A56);--border:var(--color-rule,#D8D8D3);--card-bg:var(--color-card,#FFFFFF);--highlight:var(--color-highlight,#E7E7E2);--accent:var(--color-accent,#8A3B2E);--font-display:"EB Garamond",Georgia,serif;--font-body:"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif;
  --s-thomist:#2F5E99;--s-scotist:#7A4E9B;--s-nominalist:#A87420;--s-jesuit:#1F7A80;--s-augustinian:#94506E;--s-other:#7A7A76}
/* THE CONTROVERSIES (2026-10-21, owner: "as comprehensive and deep as possible, like being able to see differences between Thomas vs
   Scotus (like Juan de Rada shows) and more"). v1/enrich/controversies (runs/minimax_1019/controversies): a pair's controversies as the
   library's own controversy literature argued them, question by question, each side in his own words.
   ORGANIZED (2026-10-21, owner: "simply organize this as well … we want to see metaphysical questions and thomas vs scotists"): one row
   grammar for the view (a label, the text, the page at the right): position, arguments, own words, judgment.
   THE DEBATES (2026-10-22, owner: "thomist vs scotus is important, has authors lined up; cajetan has substantial interaction with scotus;
   u need to do a rethink and repass of controversies"): the works of controversy under the debate each pair file names; a debate's own
   view lines its authors up (by school where the school map knows them, else side by side) and gathers its controversies under the
   classic question each answers, each side in its authors' own words. School colours are dots beside the school's name, never alone.
   One type scale: secondary .8rem, body 1rem, headings 1.25 / 1.6 / 2rem. The font tokens name their families outright: a token that
   names itself (--font-display:var(--font-display,…)) is a cycle, so CSS drops it and every heading fell back to the body's size. */
.tfr-tool *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tfr-tool a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool :is(a,button,summary,input):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
.tfr-tool [hidden]{display:none!important}
.tfr-tool .wrap{max-width:66rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1.8rem 1.2rem 4rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font:500 2rem/1.2 var(--font-display);margin:.2rem 0 .6rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .lede{max-width:70ch;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1.2rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .ct{color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.3 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .sr{position:absolute;left:-9999px}
.tfr-tool .sc-thomist{--sc:var(--s-thomist)}.tfr-tool .sc-scotist{--sc:var(--s-scotist)}.tfr-tool .sc-nominalist{--sc:var(--s-nominalist)}.tfr-tool .sc-jesuit{--sc:var(--s-jesuit)}.tfr-tool .sc-augustinian{--sc:var(--s-augustinian)}.tfr-tool .sc-othermedieval{--sc:var(--s-other)}
.tfr-tool .dot{display:inline-block;flex:none;width:.6rem;height:.6rem;margin-right:.45rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sc,var(--s-other));vertical-align:.08em}
.tfr-tool .sch{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.tfr-tool .pairs{margin:0 0 1.6rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;padding:.65rem .1rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary>span:first-child{flex:none;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary::after{content:"";flex:none;width:.42rem;height:.42rem;border-right:1.5px solid currentColor;border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor;transform:translateY(-.15rem) rotate(45deg);margin-left:.15rem}
.tfr-tool .pairs[open]>summary::after{transform:translateY(.1rem) rotate(-135deg)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary .cur{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font:1rem/1.3 var(--font-body);text-align:right;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;min-width:0}
.tfr-tool .pairs[open]>summary .cur{display:none}
.tfr-tool .pg-groups{columns:17rem 3;column-gap:2.2rem;padding:.2rem 0 .8rem}
.tfr-tool .pg-group{break-inside:avoid;margin:0 0 1.2rem}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2{margin:0 0 .25rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2 a.dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.8rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.2rem .5rem;margin:0 -.5rem;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--border);text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:4px;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2 a.dl:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2 a.dl[aria-current="page"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);text-decoration:none}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2 a.dl[aria-current="page"] .ct{color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .pg-group ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.8rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.42rem .5rem;margin:0 -.5rem;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.35 var(--font-body);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl:hover{background:var(--highlight)}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl[aria-current="page"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl[aria-current="page"] .ct{color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .pg-also{margin:.1rem 0 .45rem;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .pg-also a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pair{margin:0 0 1.4rem}
.tfr-tool .pair h2{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .45rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .pair h2 .ct,.tfr-tool .deb-head h2 .ct{margin-left:.4rem}
.tfr-tool .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);gap:.3rem 1.1rem;margin:0;max-width:72ch}
.tfr-tool .lab>div{display:contents}
.tfr-tool .lab dt{color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.95 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .lab dd{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(15rem,21rem) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.8rem;align-items:start}
.tfr-tool .nav{position:sticky;top:.8rem;max-height:calc(100vh - 1.6rem);overflow:auto}
.tfr-tool .find{width:100%;padding:.5rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:1rem var(--font-body);margin:0 0 .6rem}
.tfr-tool .find::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.35rem;margin:0 0 .8rem}
.tfr-tool .chips button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);padding:.25rem .65rem;border-radius:999px;font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .chips button .dot{margin-right:.35rem}
.tfr-tool .chips button .ct{margin-left:.3rem}
.tfr-tool .chips button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .chips button[aria-pressed="true"] .ct{color:inherit}
.tfr-tool .books{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .books details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .books summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.55rem .2rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display);list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem}
.tfr-tool .books summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .books summary small{color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .books li.lh{padding:.9rem .2rem .3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .books li.lh:first-child{padding-top:.4rem}
.tfr-tool .books ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 .6rem;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .books li button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:.4rem .3rem .4rem .8rem;border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.35 var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;border-radius:4px;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .books li button:hover{background:var(--highlight)}
.tfr-tool .books li button[aria-current="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .books li button small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .books li button[aria-current="true"] small{color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .c-head h2,.tfr-tool .c-head h4.qh{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .6rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .c-head .lab{max-width:none}
.tfr-tool .kind{display:inline-block;padding:.05rem .55rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;font:600 .8rem/1.5 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .pg{font-size:.8rem;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .r1{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:.4rem 1rem}
.tfr-tool .r1>span{min-width:0}
.tfr-tool .fold{margin:.7rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.45rem 0;font:600 .8rem/1.4 var(--sans);color:var(--muted);list-style:none}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary::before{content:"+";display:inline-block;width:1rem;font-weight:400}
.tfr-tool .fold[open]>summary::before{content:"\2212"}
.tfr-tool .rows{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .rows>li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.2rem 1rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.45rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .rows>li:first-child{border-top:0}
.tfr-tool .fold .rows{margin:0 0 .5rem}
.tfr-tool .sides{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.6rem;margin:1.4rem 0 1rem}
.tfr-tool .side :is(h3,h5){font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .2rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);text-wrap:balance;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.tfr-tool .side :is(h3,h5).long{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.4}
.tfr-tool .side h4,.tfr-tool .lbl{font:600 .8rem/1.4 var(--sans);color:var(--muted);margin:1rem 0 .3rem;display:flex;gap:.4rem;align-items:baseline}
.tfr-tool .side .pos{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool p.who{margin:0 0 .35rem;font:600 1rem/1.4 var(--font-body);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.tfr-tool p.who a{text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}
.tfr-tool ol.args{counter-reset:arg}
.tfr-tool ol.args>li{grid-template-columns:1rem minmax(0,1fr) auto;column-gap:.6rem}
.tfr-tool ol.args>li::before{counter-increment:arg;content:counter(arg);color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.6 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .gist{margin:0 0 .6rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool figure.own{margin:0 0 .9rem}
.tfr-tool .side>figure.own:first-of-type,.tfr-tool .side>h5+figure.own{margin-top:.7rem}
.tfr-tool figure.own blockquote{margin:0;padding:0 0 0 .85rem;border-left:1px solid var(--muted);font-style:italic;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool figure.own blockquote p{margin:0}
.tfr-tool figure.own figcaption{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:.3rem 1rem;margin:.3rem 0 0 .85rem;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool figure.own .says{margin:.25rem 0 0 .85rem;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .judgment{margin:1.2rem 0 0;padding:1rem 1.1rem;background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px}
.tfr-tool .judgment h3{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .35rem}
.tfr-tool .judgment .r1 p{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .across{margin:1.4rem 0 0;padding:1rem 1.1rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px}
.tfr-tool .across :is(h3,h5){font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .2rem}
.tfr-tool .across-q{margin:0 0 .7rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .across-pos{list-style:none;margin:0 0 .7rem;padding:0;display:grid;gap:.4rem}
.tfr-tool .across-pos li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(10rem,22rem) 1fr 2.5rem;gap:.2rem .6rem;align-items:center}
.tfr-tool .ap-bar{display:block;height:8px;background:var(--highlight);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.tfr-tool .ap-bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--fg);opacity:.75}
.tfr-tool .ap-n{text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .ap-who{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.1rem 1.1rem;margin:0 0 .35rem;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .ap-who .run{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline}
.tfr-tool .ap-who .run .dot{margin-right:.35rem}
.tfr-tool .ap-who b{font-weight:600;color:var(--fg);margin-right:.3rem}
.tfr-tool .across-links{margin:0;font-size:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .next{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin:1.6rem 0 0;padding-top:.8rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .next button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;cursor:pointer;padding:.2rem 0;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-align:left}
.tfr-tool .next button+button,.tfr-tool .next span+button{text-align:right}
.tfr-tool .note{max-width:72ch;margin:2rem 0 0;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .muted{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .deb-head h2{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .45rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool ul.argued{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool ul.argued li{text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool ul.argued li .ct{margin-left:.3rem}
.tfr-tool ul.argued a{text-decoration-color:var(--border);text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}
.tfr-tool ul.argued a:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor}
.tfr-tool .status{margin:.7rem 0 0;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .part{margin:2.2rem 0 0}
.tfr-tool .part>h3{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .15rem}
.tfr-tool .hint{max-width:72ch;margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .schools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.4rem 2rem}
.tfr-tool .school h4{display:flex;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 .15rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .school h4 .ct{margin-left:auto;padding-left:.6rem}
.tfr-tool ol.names,.tfr-tool ul.spk{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool ol.names li,.tfr-tool ul.spk li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.6rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.3rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.tfr-tool .also{margin:.45rem 0 0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .also a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool ol.plr{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool ol.plr>li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,.9fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:.4rem 1.6rem;padding:.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .plr-t{margin:0;font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .plr-t a{text-decoration-color:var(--border);text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:4px}
.tfr-tool .plr-t a:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor}
.tfr-tool .plr-t .ct{margin-left:.4rem}
.tfr-tool .plr-n{margin:0 0 .25rem;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool details.wk{margin:1.1rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool details.wk>summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1rem minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.4rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.6rem 0 .3rem;font:500 1rem/1.35 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool details.wk>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool details.wk>summary::before{content:"+";color:var(--muted);font:400 1rem/1 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool details.wk[open]>summary::before{content:"\2212"}
.tfr-tool details.wk .sides{margin:.6rem 0 .4rem}
.tfr-tool .cl{margin:0 0 .6rem}
.tfr-tool .cl>li{display:block}
.tfr-tool .cl a{text-decoration:none}
.tfr-tool .cl a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.tfr-tool .cl small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}
@media (max-width:900px){.tfr-tool .schools{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
.tfr-tool ol.plr>li{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr)}
.tfr-tool .plr-t{grid-column:1/-1}}
@media (max-width:760px){.tfr-tool .wrap{padding:1.2rem 1rem 3rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font-size:1.6rem}
.tfr-tool .pair h2,.tfr-tool .c-head h2,.tfr-tool .c-head h4.qh,.tfr-tool .deb-head h2{font-size:1.25rem}
.tfr-tool .cols{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.2rem}
.tfr-tool .nav{position:static;max-height:none;overflow:visible}
.tfr-tool .books{max-height:min(55vh,24rem);overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .sides{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.tfr-tool .lab{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}
.tfr-tool .lab dd{margin-bottom:.35rem}
.tfr-tool .across-pos li{grid-template-columns:1fr 2.5rem}
.tfr-tool .across-pos .ap-bar{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:2}
.tfr-tool .next{flex-direction:column}
.tfr-tool .next button+button,.tfr-tool .next span+button{text-align:left}
.tfr-tool .schools{gap:1.2rem 1.2rem}
.tfr-tool ol.plr>li{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
@media (max-width:360px){.tfr-tool .schools{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
</style>
{{/contentFor}}
{{!-- /the-faith-received/controversies/: the controversies, as The Faith Received has them (tools/prdl_reader_prototype/controversies.html, 2026-10-22):
     the works of controversy under the debate each names (Thomists and Scotists, Rome and the Reformation, the Reformed and their adversaries,
     the Lutherans and the Socinians). A debate's view (#debate/<debate>) lines its authors up by school, or side by side, and gathers its
     controversies under the classic question each answers, each side in its authors' own words; a work's view (#<pair>, #<controversy id>)
     reads its controversies one by one: each side's position and arguments with the work's page, its judgment, and each side in his own
     words from the pages of his works (v1/enrich/controversies on the library worker). The hero is the theme's; the body and
     faith-controversies.js the library's. --}}
<section class="bhero bhero--tool">
  <div class="bhero-inner container">
    <p class="bhero-kicker"><a href="/the-faith-received/">The Faith Received</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span> Controversies</p>
    <h1 class="bhero-title">The controversies</h1>
    <p class="bhero-lede">The disputes of the schools and the confessions as the library's own controversy literature argued them, debate by debate and question by question: each side's position and arguments as the work states them, the work's judgment, and each side in his own words from the pages of his works.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{asset "js/page/faith-tfr-rail.js"}}" defer></script>
<main class="tfr-tool"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="lede" id="lede" hidden>The disputes of the schools and the confessions as the library's own controversy literature argued them, debate by debate and question by question: each side's position and arguments as the work states them, the work's judgment, and each side in his own words from the pages of his works.</p>
  <div id="pairs"></div>
  <section class="deb" id="deb" aria-labelledby="debH" hidden></section>
  <div id="pv" hidden>
    <section class="pair" id="src" aria-labelledby="pairH"></section>
    <div class="cols">
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="The controversies of this work">
